  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When quiet rain falls, all sounds are absorbed and the surroundings go silent; heaven and earth become soundless so that heartbeats and breathing can be heard. The rain is mild and quiet, fresh with the smell of grass, and does not feel cold. Quiet rain is a rank six immortal material.",
      "chapters": [
        1971
      ],
