      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soundless-drizzle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Quiet Rain Valley is the resource point that creates quiet rain, and that is why the valley has its name. Fairy Bai Qing transfers there to collect quiet rain and says she will not leave. Whenever quiet rain falls, the valley carries music like zither and flute.",
